00:05:45,882 --> 00:05:51,882
This FBI agent is going undercover... and he's concealing more than a weapon.

2
00:11:31,764 --> 00:11:37,764
Big Momma's House is a crime, comedy film directed by Raja Gosnell.

3
00:17:17,647 --> 00:17:23,647
When a street-smart FBI agent is sent to Georgia to protect a beautiful single mother and her son from an escaped
convict, he is forced to impersonate a crass Southern granny known as Big Momma in order to remain incognito.

4
